                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.8212a/5: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Liberia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Walton</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Monrovia</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1939-06-01T11:00:00-00:44">June 1, 1939—11
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received 1:30 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>38. Conciliation treaty signed today at 10 o’clock a.m.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Walton</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
